@host = http://localhost:5093
@apiKey = secrets-integrations-dev-mcp-key
@token =

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### REST: list secrets (highest version of each)
GET {{host}}/api/secrets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### REST: search secrets
GET {{host}}/api/secrets?search=bank
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### REST: one secret, current version
GET {{host}}/api/secrets/Finanz Online
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### REST: one secret, a specific version
GET {{host}}/api/secrets/Finanz Online?version=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### REST: version history of one secret
GET {{host}}/api/secrets/versions/Finanz Online
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### REST: create
POST {{host}}/api/secrets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"name":"Example Service","url":"https://example.at","user":"alex","comment":"pwd here","mfa":true}

### REST: update, writes the next version
PUT {{host}}/api/secrets/Example Service
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"comment":"rotated pwd","mfa":true}

### REST: delete every version
DELETE {{host}}/api/secrets/Example Service
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### REST: full CSV export, clear text passwords, latest version only
GET {{host}}/api/secrets/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### REST: list categories
GET {{host}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### MCP: tool catalog
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"tools/list"}

### MCP: list secrets
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"list_secrets","arguments":{}}}

### MCP: version history of one secret
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"list_secret_versions","arguments":{"name":"Finanz Online"}}}

### MCP: list categories
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":4,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"list_categories","arguments":{}}}
